{"type":"message","id":"cedf7302","parentId":"db144978","timestamp":"2026-07-05T14:39:44.172Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to update all related documentation to reflect the PurpleRiver Mini 640 thermal camera (T13) cost of $650 (including $60 shipping) instead of the current $590.\n\nLet me find all files that reference the T13 cost:\n\n1. `BOM.md` - has $590 for T13\n2. `candidates.sysml` - likely has the T13 candidate cost\n3. `SELECTED_COMPONENTS.md` - might reference it\n4. Any other files\n\nLet me search for references first.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_07ea4b4c8c604e089651dd3b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && grep -rn \"590\\|T13\\|PurpleRiver\\|Mini 640\\|thermal camera\" --include=\"*.md\" --include=\"*.sysml\" . | grep -i \"590\\|purple\\|t13\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && grep -rn \\\"590\\\\|T13\\\\|PurpleRiver\\\\|Mini 640\\\\|thermal camera\\\" --include=\\\"*.md\\\" --include=\\\"*.sysml\\\" . | grep -i \\\"590\\\\|purple\\\\|t13\\\"\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":19540,"output":225,"cacheRead":1024,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":113,"totalTokens":20789,"cost":{"input":0.001954,"output":0.000044999999999999996,"cacheRead":0.00002048,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0020194799999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783262378539,"responseId":"gen-1783262379-xMd6sPWjlFzHgRxp7uRK"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b273975e","parentId":"cedf7302","timestamp":"2026-07-05T14:39:44.318Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_07ea4b4c8c604e089651dd3b","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"./MODEL_ISSUES.md:422:    constraint — the **90×62 mm NanoPi M5 footprint** is. **Result (T13+SBC3,\n./memory/2026-06-06.md:11:- **Top recommendation**: PurpleRiver Mini 640 with 13mm lens (~$479 total) — meets all requirements, $121 under $600 camera cap\n./memory/2026-06-06.md:19:- **PurpleRiver Mini 640**: 640×512, 12µm, ≤50mK NETD, 31.9° HFOV (13mm), <20g, <0.5W, CVBS+USB+MIPI, $399 base\n./memory/2026-06-06.md:24:1. Need live PurpleRiver quote (single-unit, 13mm lens + CVBS adapter + shipping)\n./memory/2026-06-06.md:34:- Camera subsystem cost: ~$479 (PurpleRiver est.) — well within $600 camera cap\n./systems_engineering_plan.md:49:- Thermal Camera Subsystem — **PurpleRiver Mini 640** (`T13`, 640×512, 12 µm, 13 mm lens, USB)\n./CLAUDE.md:65:**Holistic sweep:** fully crosses the flight-time drivers — airframe × battery × SBC × VTX × thermal camera — holds the sub-1 W peripherals (FPV cam, GPS, RX) at lightest representatives, then **filters out incompatible pairings** per the model's `Compatibility` rules: **P1** battery↔airframe cell-count (drops e.g. a 4S pack on a 6S-only frame) and **V2** thermal↔DVR (a thermal no DVR can record — raw SPI/CMOS — is dropped). The **DVR is not crossed and is excluded from flight time**: it is an earlier-stage (Phase 1-2) part, so the headline endurance is the SBC-stage build (SBC present, DVR removed); the DVR is kept only for earlier-stage camera↔DVR compatibility and for cost. **Thermal camera locked to T13** (PurpleRiver Mini 640) via `FIXED_THERMAL_ID` and **SBC locked to SBC3** (NanoPi M5, RK3576) via `FIXED_SBC_ID` — David's design choices, so neither is swept (set either to `None` to sweep all again). With T13 + SBC3 fixed: **186 real configs** (all meet R4). Falls back to a generated generic LiPo/Li-ion grid only if no Battery candidates exist in `candidates.sysml`. **15 of 16 airframes participate** (AF5/EMAX Hawk 7 still lacks a confirmed mass; the discontinued KOLAS7 PNP and GEPRC MARK4 LR7 were removed 2026-06-27 — MARK4 replaced by the GEPRC MOZ7 V2 family: AF1a Analog / AF1b WTFPV / AF1c O4 Pro). **Recommended baseline:** DarwinFPV 129 (AF9a) + 4S 12Ah Amprius + T13 + SBC3 → 69.1 min hover, ~$1,505 system (well under the $2,500 R4 cap). (The earlier KOLAS7 \"71 min winner\" was a data artifact — its modeled mass omitted the 188 g of motors; corrected to as-built ~540–565 g, see `MODEL_ISSUES.md` §D.) See also `MODEL_ISSUES.md` §C11-C12.\n./SELECTED_COMPONENTS.md:42:| **Thermal camera** | **PurpleRiver Mini 640** (640×512, 12 µm, 13 mm lens, USB) | `T13` | earlier | `FIXED_THERMAL_ID = \"T13\"` | meets Johnson detect/recognize at 90–120 m; USB output. | **2** |\n./SELECTED_COMPONENTS.md:106:**Chimera9 ECO (AF3a PNP) + [battery TBD, leading BAT09] + T13 + SBC3** → ~58.6 min hover, ~$1,645 system (well under the $2,500 R4 cap), SBC fits the deck. See\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:9:- **34 real configurations** = airframe × battery × VTX, fully crossed (respecting airframe component inclusion) and **filtered for interface compatibility**; thermal fixed to **T13** and SBC fixed to **SBC3** (design choices, not swept). The DVR is compatibility-gated, not crossed, and excluded from flight time (it is an earlier-stage part; the SBC records at the SBC stage).\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:26:**iFlight Chimera9 ECO** (AF3a) + **Lumenier NAV 12000mAh 6S 21700 Amprius**, SBC SBC3, VTX included, thermal T13 → **58.4 min** hover (1750.7 g AUW, 14.9% throttle; drone $1567 / system $1738 ≤ $2,500 R4).\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:32:| C000008 | iFlight Chimera9 ECO (AF3a) | Lumenier NAV 12000mAh 6S 21700 Amprius | SBC3 | included | T13 | 1750.7 | 16.85 | 58.4 | 60.0 | 71.9 | 14.9 | 1567.47 | 1738.47 | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅ |\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:33:| C000025 | DarwinFPV X9 (AF4a) | Lumenier NAV 12000mAh 6S 21700 Amprius | SBC3 | included | T13 | 1772.7 | 16.8 | 57.4 | 58.9 | 70.7 | 13.7 | 1525.47 | 1696.47 | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅ |\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:34:| C000009 | iFlight Chimera9 ECO (AF3a) | Upgrade Energy GREEN V2 6S3P 12Ah Amprius SA10 | SBC3 | included | T13 | 1749.7 | 16.85 | 56.9 | 58.4 | 70.0 | 14.9 | 1520.98 | 1691.98 | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅ |\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:35:| C000026 | DarwinFPV X9 (AF4a) | Upgrade Energy GREEN V2 6S3P 12Ah Amprius SA10 | SBC3 | included | T13 | 1771.7 | 16.8 | 55.9 | 57.4 | 68.9 | 13.6 | 1478.98 | 1649.98 | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅ |\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:36:| C000003 | iFlight Chimera9 ECO (AF3a) | Upgrade Energy RED V3 6S2P 10Ah Molicel P50B | SBC3 | included | T13 | 1698.7 | 16.85 | 49.4 | 50.7 | 61.0 | 14.5 | 1497.98 | 1668.98 | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅ |\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:37:| C000006 | iFlight Chimera9 ECO (AF3a) | Upgrade Energy GREEN V2 6S2P 8Ah Amprius SA10 | SBC3 | included | T13 | 1447.7 | 16.85 | 49.2 | 50.8 | 62.2 | 12.3 | 1439.98 | 1610.98 | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅ |\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:38:| C000020 | DarwinFPV X9 (AF4a) | Upgrade Energy RED V3 6S2P 10Ah Molicel P50B | SBC3 | included | T13 | 1720.7 | 16.8 | 48.5 | 49.8 | 60.0 | 13.3 | 1455.98 | 1626.98 | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅ |\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:39:| C000023 | DarwinFPV X9 (AF4a) | Upgrade Energy GREEN V2 6S2P 8Ah Amprius SA10 | SBC3 | included | T13 | 1469.7 | 16.8 | 48.2 | 49.7 | 61.1 | 11.3 | 1397.98 | 1568.98 | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅ |\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:40:| C000002 | iFlight Chimera9 ECO (AF3a) | Upgrade Energy GREEN V1 6S2P 10Ah Samsung 50S | SBC3 | included | T13 | 1730.7 | 16.85 | 48.1 | 49.4 | 59.3 | 14.8 | 1515.97 | 1686.97 | ✅ | ✅ | — | ✅ |\n./analysis/flight_time_results.md:41:| C000019 | DarwinFPV X9 (AF4a) | Upgrade Energy GREEN V1 6S2P 10Ah Samsung 50S | SBC3 | included | T13 | 1752.7 | 16.8 | 47.3 | 48.6 | 58.4 | 13.5 | 1473.97 | 1644.97 | ✅ | ✅ | —