VR. Replace DVR with SBC in components. Update steps.\n   - Phase 3: Remove entirely or update to reflect it's now merged into Phase 2.\n\n3. **SELECTED_COMPONENTS.md**:\n   - Change DVR9 status from \"open (Phase 2)\" to something appropriate\n   - Move SBC3 reference\n\n4. **REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md**: Update phase descriptions\n\n5. **CLAUDE.md**: Update to reflect new phase structure\n\nLet me check if CLAUDE.md exists and what's in the requirements files.\n\nActually, let me also check the model.sysml and candidates.sysml for DVR9 references.\n\nLet me be strategic here. Let me read the key files first, then make all the edits.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_255b2d8c8c2847539efc860f","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":5,"offset":45,"path":"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone/REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"limit\": 5, \"offset\": 45, \"path\": \"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone/REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ade10a25b57540df9958e06d","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":3,"offset":48,"path":"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone/REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"limit\": 3, \"offset\": 48, \"path\": \"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone/REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fa1280e724ee4be599d88e90","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && grep -n \"Phase 2\\|Phase 3\" REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && grep -n \\\"Phase 2\\\\|Phase 3\\\" REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_964dfc668e7647608c798c61","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone && grep