{"type":"message","id":"24c799a5","parentId":"df97bbe0","timestamp":"2026-07-05T15:16:36.216Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ade10a25b57540df9958e06d","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### 3.1 Required states and modes\nThe system is fielded in three incremental capability phases (operational modes), each a superset of the prior (see `systems_engineering_plan.md`):\n1. **Phase 1 — Flight + FPV + waypoints:** airframe + ELRS control link + battery + FPV/analog video downlink to the laptop + GPS pre-programmed waypoint routes.\n\n[174 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1783264596216}}
{"type":"message","id":"809e02c0","parentId":"24c799a5","timestamp":"2026-07-05T15:16:36.217Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fa1280e724ee4be599d88e90","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"51:2. **Phase 2 — Thermal + recording:** adds the thermal camera + onboard DVR (footage survives RF loss).\n52:3. **Phase 3 — Onboard autonomy:** adds the SBC for live detection/classification + autonomous route modification (MAVLink). *The DVR is a Phase 1–2 part; at Phase 3 the SBC records.*\n140:- **Reliability:** control and video links reliable to ≥ 2.8 km LOS (**R4_GCS_RANGE**); footage retained on-card independent of RF link quality (Phase 3 DVR)."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":13,"aggregated":"51:2. **Phase 2 — Thermal + recording:** adds the thermal camera + onboard DVR (footage survives RF loss).\n52:3. **Phase 3 — Onboard autonomy:** adds the SBC for live detection/classification + autonomous route modification (MAVLink). *The DVR is a Phase 1–2 part; at Phase 3 the SBC records.*\n140:- **Reliability:** control and video links reliable to ≥ 2.8 km LOS (**R4_GCS_RANGE**); footage retained on-card independent of RF link quality (Phase 3 DVR).","cwd":"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1783264596216}}
