{"type":"message","id":"7116210b","parentId":"3dd343bf","timestamp":"2026-07-05T15:18:52.101Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"That's a lot of files. Let me categorize them:\n\n1. **model.sysml** — The SysML v2 model. This has the DVR part definition and instances. The memory says this file CANNOT be modified without explicit approval. So I need to ask David before touching model.sysml.\n\n2. **candidates.sysml** — The candidate database. DVR9 is a candidate here. Need to remove or mark it.\n\n3. **BOM.md** — Remove DVR9 from Phase 2, move SBC to Phase 2.\n\n4. **SELECTED_COMPONENTS.md** — Remove DVR entry from the selection table.\n\n5. **systems_engineering_plan.md** — Rewrite Phase 2/3 descriptions.\n\n6. **CLAUDE.md** — Project notes, update references.\n\n7. **README.md** — Project readme.\n\n8. **MODEL_ISSUES.md** — History of issues/decisions; add a new issue note about this decision.\n\n9. **REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md** — Update phase descriptions.\n\n10. **analysis/flight_time_instances.sysml** — Has `thermalCam = \"T13\"` references. Need to check if DVR is referenced.\n\n11. **analysis/flight_time_results.md** — Flight time results; DVR isn't in flight time so these might be fine.\n\n12. **analysis/flight_time_value_ranking.md** — Ditto.\n\n13. **analysis/market_analyses_and_research/thermal_dvr_market_analysis.md** — This is a research doc about DVRs; might be worth updating but it's historical research.\n\nLet me first read model.sysml for DVR references since that needs explicit approval per memory policy.\n\nActually wait - the memory policy says \"cannot be modified, updated, moved, or removed without explicit prior approval\". So I need to ask David about model.sysml specifically.\n\nLet me also check what's in model.sysml and candidates.sysml regarding the DVR, to present a complete picture.\n\nLet me start reading the key files to understand the full scope.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"ty