unt) = $936.00\n- Phase 3 (old): $141.00 → Phase 3 (new): $0 (software only)\n- Grand total: $1,354.75 + $936.00 + $0 = $2,290.75\n\nR4 system cost: $2,290.75 - $220 (dev batteries) - $100 (charger, approx) = ~$1,970.75\n\nActually wait, the original R4 system cost was $2,088 which was derived by subtracting $220 (dev BAT22 x2) and \"the CHG1 charger ($100)\". Let me be more precise.\n\nOld Grand total: ~$2,419.75\n- Minus BAT22 x2: $220\n- Minus CHG1: $111.55 (exact)\nOr \"~$100\" was an approximation.\n\nLet me use the exact figures. Old grand total $2,419.75. Remove DVR $129, move SBC $141 from Phase 3 to Phase 2. Net change: -$129.\n\nNew grand total: $2,419.75 - $129 = $2,290.75\n\nR4 system cost = grand total minus non-flight items (BAT22 x2 = $220, CHG1 = $111.55)\nActually the original said \"the CHG1 charger ($100)\" - approximate. Let me use:\n$2,290.75 - $220 (BAT22) - $111.55 (CHG1) = $1,959.20\n\nOr with approximate charger: $2,290.75 - $220 - $100 = $1,970.75\n\nLet me just use ~$1,970 for R4 system cost, well under $2,500 ✓\n\nActually, let me be more careful. The BOM.txt note says \"charged\" was $100 approximate. Let me use consistent math.\n\nOld grand total: $2,419.75\n- BAT22 x2: $220.00 (exact from BOM)\n- CHG1: $111.55 (exact from BOM)\nOld R4: $2,419.75 - $220.00 - $111.55 = $2,088.20 (≈$2,088)\n\nNew grand total: $2,419.75 - $129.00 = $2,290.75\nNew R4: $2,290.75 - $220.00 - $111.55 = $1,959.20 ≈ $1,959\n\nOK, now let me plan all the edits. I'll update the plan and start the edits.\n\nLet me batch the edits. Starting with the independent files simultaneously.\n\nFor model.sysml, I need to remove:\n1. `part def ThermalVideoRecorder {` through to the closing `}` (lines 732-~765)\n2. `part recorder : ThermalVideoRecorder;` (line 962)\n\nLet me read the exact text around those lines to get the precise matching text.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full picture. Let me update the plan and start the batch edits.\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_57c31aad5e3f4a27a138c775","name":"update_plan","arguments":{"plan":[{"step":"Update model.sysml — remove ThermalVideoRecorder def + recorder part","status":"in_progress"},{"step":"Update BOM.md — move SBC to Phase 2, drop DVR, recalc totals","status":"pending"},{"step":"Update systems_engineering_plan.md — merge SBC into Phase 2, Phase 3 becomes SW-only","status":"pending"},{"step":"Update SELECTED_COMPONENTS.md — remove DVR open item row","status":"pending"},{"step":"Update REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md — phase descriptions","status":"pending"},{"step":"Update CLAUDE.md, README.md — architecture description changes","status":"pending"},{"step":"Update analysis/flight_time_results.md + flight_time_value_ranking.md — prose changes","status":"pending"},{"step":"Update MODEL_ISSUES.md — append new decision entry","status":"pending"}]},"partialArgs":"{\"plan\": [{\"step\": \"Update model.sysml — remove ThermalVideoRecorder def + recorder part\", \"status\": \"in_progress\"}, {\"step\": \"Update BOM.md — move SBC to Phase 2, drop DVR, recalc totals\", \"status\": \"pending\"}, {\"step\": \"Update systems_engineering_plan.md — merge SBC into Phase 2, Phase 3 becomes SW-only\", \"status\": \"pending\"}, {\"step\": \"Update SELECTED_COMPONENTS.md — remove DVR open item row\", \"status\": \"pending\"}, {\"step\": \"Update REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md — phase descriptions\", \"status\": \"pending\"}, {\"step\": \"Update CLAUDE.md, README.md — architecture description changes\", \"status\": \"pending\"}, {\"step\": \"Update analysis/flight_time_results.md + flight_time_value_ranking.md — prose changes\", \"status\": \"pending\"}, {\"step\": \"Update MODEL_ISSUES.md — append new decision entry\", \"status\": \"pending\"}]}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":963,"output":2020,"cacheRead":63232,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":1739,"totalTokens":66215,"cos