{"type":"message","id":"07a65dff","parentId":"2e7949ea","timestamp":"2026-07-05T15:27:13.685Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, sed worked for the value ranking file. Now let me update the remaining files: README.md, CLAUDE.md, and MODEL_ISSUES.md.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"type":"text","text":"Now the remaining files: README.md, CLAUDE.md, and MODEL_ISSUES.md.\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c766837a8b734331bd355ffd","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"All SBC/thermal components are now unified in Phase 2; Phase 3 is software-only (RKNN model deployment, MAVLink integrationtion).}, {\"newText\": \"DVR, and ground-station specifics.\", \"oldText\": \"DVR, and ground-station specifics.\"}, {\"newText\": \"\\n- Component defs — **Airframe**, **Battery**, **CameraSubsystem** (thermal), **FpvCamera**, **GpsModule**, **SingleBoardComputerPayload**, **RadioReceiver**, **VideoTransmitter**, **VideoReceiver**, **UsbVideoCapture**, **Antenna** (gain, band, polarization), **AntiSparkFilter**, **Charger**\", \"oldText\": \"\\n- Component defs — **Airframe** (incl. `minCells_s`/`maxCells_s`, `maxThrustPerMotor_g`, and a **physical-integration layer**: `payloadDeckLength_mm`/`payloadDeckWidth_mm`/`payloadCapacity_g`/`batteryMount`), **Battery** (energy, chemistry, cells, `length/width/height_mm`), **CameraSubsystem** (thermal), **FpvCamera**, **GpsModule**, **SingleBoardComputerPayload**, **ThermalVideoRecorder** (CVBS + digital DVR variants), **RadioReceiver**, **VideoTransmitter**, **VideoReceiver**, **UsbVideoCapture**, **Antenna** (`gain_dBi`, band, polarization — feeds the RF link budget), **AntiSparkFilter** (inline XT60, in the drone power path), **Charger** (6S Li-ion/LiPo bench charger — ground-support equipment).\"}, {\"newText\": \"receivers, and ground video receivers.\", \"oldText\": \"receivers, DVRs, and ground video receivers.\"}, {\"newText\": \"- **Compatibility filtering (executes the model's rules):** **P1** battery↔airframe cell-count. DVR compatibility filter removed (DVR dropped from architecture 2026-07-05 — SBC handles recording).\", \"oldText\": \"- **Compatibility filtering (executes the model's rules):** **P1** battery↔airframe cell-count, **V2** thermal↔DVR video format. The DVR is excluded from max-flight-time (it's a Phase 1–2 part; the SBC records at Phase 3) but kept for earlier-stage compatibility + cost.\"}, {\"newText\": \"**(2)** thermal camera + SBC onboard recording + OpenHD digital downlink → **(3)** AI detection/autonomous route modification (software-only, no new hardware).\", \"oldText\": \"**(2)** thermal camera + onboard DVR recording → **(3)** onboard SBC detection/classification\"}]","path":"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone/README.md"}]},"partialArgs":"{\"edits\": [{\"newText\": \"All SBC/thermal components are now unified in Phase 2; Phase 3 is software-only (RKNN model deployment, MAVLink integrationtion).}, {\\\"newText\\\": \\\"DVR, and ground-station specifics.\\\", \\\"oldText\\\": \\\"DVR, and ground-station specifics.\\\"}, {\\\"newText\\\": \\\"\\\\n- Component defs — **Airframe**, **Battery**, **CameraSubsystem** (thermal), **FpvCamera**, **GpsModule**, **SingleBoardComputerPayload**, **RadioReceiver**, **VideoTransmitter**, **VideoReceiver**, **UsbVideoCapture**, **Antenna** (gain, band, polarization), **AntiSparkFilter**, **Charger**\\\", \\\"oldText\\\": \\\"\\\\n- Component defs — **Airframe** (incl. `minCells_s`/`maxCells_s`, `maxThrustPerMotor_g`, and a **physical-integration layer**: `payloadDeckLength_mm`/`payloadDeckWidth_mm`/`payloadCapacity_g`/`batteryMount`), **Battery** (energy, chemistry, cells, `length/width/height_mm`), **CameraSubsystem** (thermal), **FpvCamera**, **GpsModule**, **SingleBoardComputerPayload**, **ThermalVideoRecorder** (CVBS + digital DVR variants), **RadioReceiver**, **VideoTransmitter**, **VideoReceiver**, **UsbVideoCapture**, **Antenna** (`gain_dBi`, band, polarization — feeds the RF link budget), **AntiSparkFilter** (inline XT60, in the drone power path), **Charger** (6S Li-ion/LiPo bench charger — ground-support equipment).\\\"}, {\\\"newText\\\": \\\"receivers, and ground video receivers.\\\", \\\"oldText\\\": \\\"receivers, DVRs, and ground video receivers.\\\"}, {\\\"newText\\\": \\\"- **Compatibility filtering (executes the model's rules):** **P1** battery↔airframe cell-count. DVR compatibility filter removed (DVR dropped from architecture 2026-07-05 — SBC handles recording).\\\", \\\"oldText\\\": \\\"- **Compatibility filtering (executes the model's rules):** **P1** battery↔airframe cell-count, **V2** thermal↔DVR video format. The DVR is excluded from max-flight-time (it's a Phase 1–2 part; the SBC records at Phase 3) but kept for earlier-stage compatibility + cost.\\\"}, {\\\"newText\\\": \\\"**(2)** thermal camera + SBC onboard recording + OpenHD digital downlink → **(3)** AI detection/autonomous route modification (software-only, no new hardware).\\\", \\\"oldText\\\": \\\"**(2)** thermal camera + onboard DVR recording → **(3)** onboard SBC detection/classification\\\"}]\", \"path\": \"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone/README.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":272,"output":732,"cacheRead":82688,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":34,"totalTokens":83692,"cost":{"input":0.000027199999999999997,"output":0.00014639999999999998,"cacheRead":0.00165376,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00182736}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783265222394,"responseId":"gen-1783265222-Wp1JF1nym3PsNwqpkuve"}}
