{"type":"message","id":"d90f41da","parentId":"d20aee87","timestamp":"2026-07-05T15:35:12.245Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The INTERFACE_REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT has several DVR references — IF-VID-01, IF-VID-04, and PWR/DVR mentions. And the REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT has DVR in the acronyms list. Let me clean those up too.\n\nThe INTERFACE_REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT needs updating since those interfaces no longer exist (camToRec and recToVtx were removed from model.sysml). The acronym \"DVR\" can stay as a general term but the interfaces should be removed.\n\nLet me read the relevant sections of the INTERFACE_REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_details"},{"type":"text","text":"Found it — `INTERFACE_REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md` still has the old DVR interfaces. Let me fix that and the acronyms line"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f9ba0c012a5c4fc8b47ea886","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":40,"offset":48,"path":"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone/INTERFACE_REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"limit\": 40, \"offset\": 48, \"path\": \"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone/INTERFACE_REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_475d0bab8f4c42fb9b4a17fa","name":"read","arguments":{"limit":40,"offset":93,"path":"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone/INTERFACE_REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"limit\": 40, \"offset\": 93, \"path\": \"/home/david12daniel/.openclaw/agents/thermal-surveillance-drone/INTERFACE_REQUIREMENTS_EXPORT_26_06_30.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":6586,"output":370,"cacheRead":90112,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoningTokens":126,"totalTokens":97068,"cost":{"input":0.0006586,"output":0.000074,"cacheRead":0.00180224,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00253484}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1783265703149,"respo